---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="The terms that apply when you book a trip or use the Wild Excursions website."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-carbon/60 dark:text-brand-ivory/60">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold">Booking</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      Trips shown on this site are itinerary examples, not confirmed bookings. Availability, exact pricing, and dates
      are confirmed directly with you after you submit an enquiry or speak with one of our team. A booking is
      confirmed once a 50% advance payment is received; the remaining balance is due at least 30 days before your
      tour departure date.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold">Pricing</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      Prices displayed are indicative and can change based on group size, season, and availability at the time of
      booking. We'll always confirm final pricing with you before you pay anything.
    </p>

    <h2 id="cancellations" class="mt-8 scroll-mt-24 text-2xl font-bold">Cancellations &amp; refunds</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      Cancellation requests must be sent by email. Refunds are calculated from your tour cost based on how far ahead
      of departure you cancel:
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      <li>120 days or more before departure — 100% refund</li>
      <li>60 days or more before departure — 75% refund</li>
      <li>45–60 days before departure — 50% refund</li>
      <li>30–45 days before departure — 25% refund</li>
      <li>Within 30 days of departure, or no-show — no refund</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      Approved refunds are processed within 7–8 working days, to the bank details you provide, less any bank or
      transaction fees. As an alternative to a refund, we're also happy to rebook your trip for a future departure
      date at no change fee. Travelers are responsible for any non-refundable third-party expenses they've incurred,
      such as flights.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold">Force majeure &amp; on safari</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      Wild Excursions may need to modify or cancel a tour due to circumstances outside our control — severe weather,
      natural disasters, strikes, political unrest, or a change in forest department rules. Where this happens, we'll
      make every reasonable effort to offer suitable alternative arrangements; any additional cost this creates is
      borne by the traveler, and no refund is owed for schedule changes made for these reasons.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      Wildlife safaris take place in natural, unpredictable environments, and no sighting is ever guaranteed — our
      naturalists and drivers use their experience to give you the best possible chance. Travelers are expected to
      follow their guide's and driver's instructions at all times, for their own safety and the safety of the
      wildlife. Wild Excursions is not liable for injury, loss, or damage arising from participation in a safari or
      from events beyond our reasonable control.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold">Site content</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      The text, photos, and itineraries on this site belong to Wild Excursions unless stated otherwise, and shouldn't
      be reused without permission.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold">Governing law</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      These terms are governed by Indian law, and any disputes are subject to the jurisdiction of the courts at
      Umred district, Maharashtra.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold">Questions</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      Reach out at <a href="mailto:info@wildexcursions.in" class="text-brand-gold hover:underline dark:text-brand-amber">info@wildexcursions.in</a>
      or <a href="tel:+917755958493" class="text-brand-gold hover:underline dark:text-brand-amber">+91 77559 58493</a> if anything here needs clarifying.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
